HFC-04: grounds → UC01-F2-CL4, UC01-F2-CL5, UC03-F6-CL12; explains → HV-07, HV-08; associated-measure → M-05, M-04.

HFC-05: grounds → UC03-F6-CL12, UC03-F6-CL13; explains → HV-05, HV-08; associated-measure → M-11, M-06.

HFC-06: grounds → UC01-F2-CL6; explains → HV-02; associated-measure → M-08, M-04.

HFC-07: grounds → UC01-F4-CL7, UC02-F3-CL11; explains → HV-03; associated-measure → M-08.

HFC-08: grounds → UC02-F3-CL11, UC01-F2-CL6; explains → HV-02, HV-03; informs → TECH-01; associated-measure → M-08, M-05.

